   521	(a″_k), also works: Lemma W is not needed.) A prime ℓ is MF-descendable if some P ∈ 𝒫 ∩ Λ_ℓ(g) has Y_P = 1
   522	(rational, filtered) and F_j(P) ∈ 𝒮_B for some j.
