   530	  Pr_{c_j}[F_j(P₀) ∈ 𝒮_B] ≥ ρ_F/(log N)^{C_g} =: p₁ (its residue c_{P₀}w_j is a unit, [pp] Lemma `lem:coprime`).
   531	  The pairs (w_j, c_j) are independent of each other and of (g, ℓ), so
   532	  Pr[no j | g, ℓ] ≤ (1 − p₁)^{J_f} ≤ e^{−1} < 1/2.
