   534	  rational part of FM-U, with the bad-mass bound of §4), and E[N_r^{good}(N_r^{good} − 1)] ≤ E[N_r(N_r − 1)] ≤
   535	  (log N)^C S⁴ρ_r² ([pp] Prop `prop:R` = Theorem R, uniform: it is rational-only, uses Lemma `lem:reg` with ≤ 200S²
   536	  partners and DS-U). With S² ≥ (log N)^{−C}/ρ_r (a rational-only Lemma CS), Paley–Zygmund gives γ_r ≥ (log N)^{−C}. ∎
